この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,93.9 9.1,94.3 14.2,94.5 19.3,93.9 24.5,96.4 29.6,97.2 34.7,95.9 39.8,93.2 44.9,87.6 50.0,86.7 55.1,84.6 60.3,83.5 65.4,84.3 70.5,82.4 75.6,80.7 80.7,81.0 85.8,80.8 91.0,77.7 96.1,74.5 101.2,67.9 106.3,69.9 111.4,70.1 116.5,65.4 121.6,55.3 126.8,57.4 131.9,54.3 137.0,53.9 142.1,57.9 147.2,59.6 152.3,62.0 157.4,62.0 162.6,58.5 167.7,54.7 172.8,50.4 177.9,50.6 183.0,57.5 188.1,63.0 193.2,55.0 198.4,52.4 203.5,50.1 208.6,45.9 213.7,50.7 218.8,51.6 223.9,50.8 229.0,50.4 234.2,44.9 239.3,46.7 244.4,41.1 249.5,35.0 254.6,31.8 259.7,35.4 264.9,25.8 270.0,34.4 275.1,25.1 280.2,18.5 285.3,26.5 290.4,25.4 295.5,19.7 300.7,20.8 305.8,22.3 310.9,21.8 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,96.2 6.1,95.4 8.3,96.8 10.4,94.5 12.5,95.1 14.7,95.9 16.8,93.2 19.0,94.8 21.1,95.9 23.2,95.7 25.4,96.5 27.5,96.4 29.6,97.0 31.8,97.2 33.9,97.1 36.1,97.2 38.2,96.7 40.3,96.7 42.5,96.6 44.6,96.8 46.7,94.8 48.9,95.1 51.0,94.0 53.2,93.6 55.3,93.0 57.4,91.8 59.6,93.